.fluent-sandbox
# Static-pass output is regenerated by `npm run extract:code --
# examples/fluent/extract.config.json` (same rule as examples/{carbon,shadcn}).
# The ONE exception is the drafted capture config: it is the artifact the
# review gate acts on, and RECON.md §4 is only auditable next to it.
out/*
!out/capture-config.draft.json
